WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.291 --> 00:00:08.432
Matt's family just moved to a new town.

2
00:00:08.873 --> 00:00:10.313
He needs to go to a new school.

3
00:00:10.934 --> 00:00:13.075
He is also going to need to make new friends.

4
00:00:13.455 --> 00:00:15.997
But it's not easy to make new friends in a new school.

5
00:00:16.017 --> 00:00:17.778
"This is Matt.

6
00:00:18.218 --> 00:00:20.439
I'm sure you'll make him feel welcome."

7
00:00:20.879 --> 00:00:23.121
Mrs. Emory introduced him to the class.

8
00:00:23.621 --> 00:00:25.762
Matt sat next to a girl named Georgia.

9
00:00:25.782 --> 00:00:28.063
"Hi, I'm Georgia!"

10
00:00:28.444 --> 00:00:28.884
she said.

11
00:00:29.428 --> 00:00:31.029
Matt pretended to tie his shoelace.

12
00:00:31.589 --> 00:00:33.489
He was too shy to talk to Georgia.

13
00:00:34.289 --> 00:00:36.390
Matt's first day of school wasn't too bad.

14
00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:38.751
At least no one else tried to talk to him.

15
00:00:38.771 --> 00:00:40.631
"You're the new kid, right?"

16
00:00:41.091 --> 00:00:42.292
asked Jeff after school.

17
00:00:42.312 --> 00:00:44.952
"Do you want to play basketball with us?"

18
00:00:45.573 --> 00:00:46.733
asked a boy named Spike.

19
00:00:47.553 --> 00:00:48.413
Matt shook his head.

20
00:00:48.433 --> 00:00:50.774
"Okay, see you tomorrow!"

21
00:00:51.194 --> 00:00:51.754
said Jeff.

22
00:00:52.234 --> 00:00:54.055
"Okay, see you tomorrow!"

23
00:00:54.535 --> 00:00:55.135
said Spike.

24
00:00:55.615 --> 00:00:57.316
Matt was feeling angry with himself.

25
00:00:58.056 --> 00:01:00.458
"Why didn't I say something?"

26
00:01:00.778 --> 00:01:01.519
he said aloud.

27
00:01:01.539 --> 00:01:04.921
"They probably think I'm stupid!"

28
00:01:05.601 --> 00:01:06.622
Matt wasn't stupid.

29
00:01:06.882 --> 00:01:08.023
He was just very shy.

30
00:01:08.984 --> 00:01:11.665
At his old school, it took Matt almost a year to make friends.

31
00:01:12.986 --> 00:01:15.008
He never felt comfortable speaking to people.

32
00:01:15.548 --> 00:01:17.649
Matt wished he could live on a deserted island.

33
00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:20.772
That way he would never have to say anything to anyone.

34
00:01:21.212 --> 00:01:23.774
After school, Matt watched the soccer team practicing.

35
00:01:24.134 --> 00:01:26.375
Matt's new school had a very good soccer team.

36
00:01:26.756 --> 00:01:29.389
In fact, they were one of the top teams in the league.

37
00:01:29.409 --> 00:01:32.509
"But Coach, I'll be better soon!"

38
00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:33.710
moaned Ben.

39
00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:35.850
Ben was the team's midfielder.

40
00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:38.391
He had broken his leg during the last match.

41
00:01:38.411 --> 00:01:39.871
"Are you new here?

42
00:01:40.311 --> 00:01:42.472
I'm Coach Klein," a voice called out.

43
00:01:42.492 --> 00:01:44.413
"Hi, I'm Ben!"

44
00:01:44.673 --> 00:01:46.093
the boy with crutches said to Matt.

45
00:01:46.113 --> 00:01:48.354
"Immad," Matt mumbled.

46
00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:50.574
"What?" asked Ben.

47
00:01:50.594 --> 00:01:54.055
"I'm Matt," he said more clearly this time.

48
00:01:54.075 --> 00:01:57.056
"Matt, have you ever played soccer before?"

49
00:01:57.548 --> 00:01:58.388
Coach Klein asked.

50
00:01:58.988 --> 00:02:01.169
Matt answered, "Well, sort of."

51
00:02:01.789 --> 00:02:04.650
Matt used to play soccer with his friends from his old neighborhood.

52
00:02:05.010 --> 00:02:06.871
But he had never played on a team before.

53
00:02:07.351 --> 00:02:09.831
Ben promised to help Matt become a good midfielder.

54
00:02:10.492 --> 00:02:14.293
"I don't know if I can do it," Matt said in a low voice.

55
00:02:14.313 --> 00:02:18.014
"What? I can't hear a word you're saying!"

56
00:02:18.434 --> 00:02:19.334
Ben said loudly.

57
00:02:20.374 --> 00:02:22.935
Every day after school, Matt practiced with the team.

58
00:02:23.755 --> 00:02:25.776
Matt tried his best to be a good midfielder.

59
00:02:26.348 --> 00:02:28.869
He ran to head the ball but collided with Victor.

60
00:02:28.889 --> 00:02:31.429
"You're supposed to call it!"

61
00:02:31.970 --> 00:02:32.630
shouted Victor.

62
00:02:32.650 --> 00:02:37.531
"Matt! When you're going for the ball, you must let your teammates know!"

63
00:02:38.091 --> 00:02:39.011
Coach Klein told him.

64
00:02:39.932 --> 00:02:41.752
"Sorry," mumbled Matt.

65
00:02:43.553 --> 00:02:44.873
The coach was worried about Matt.

66
00:02:46.914 --> 00:02:51.935
"I don't think it's going to work with Matt," Coach Klein said to Ben.

67
00:02:51.955 --> 00:02:54.176
"We need to find someone else."

68
00:02:54.196 --> 00:02:57.501
"Coach Klein, please give Matt another chance.

69
00:02:57.962 --> 00:02:59.242
Look at how he moves!"

70
00:03:00.023 --> 00:03:00.603
Ben pleaded.

71
00:03:00.623 --> 00:03:05.567
"Matt just needs to learn about teamwork.

72
00:03:06.147 --> 00:03:06.908
I'll help him!"

73
00:03:07.268 --> 00:03:07.828
Ben said.

74
00:03:07.848 --> 00:03:13.112
"Soccer is about teamwork," Ben explained.

75
00:03:13.132 --> 00:03:17.034
"Everyone is like a different instrument in an orchestra.

76
00:03:17.615 --> 00:03:20.316
We need to play together in harmony.

77
00:03:20.937 --> 00:03:23.318
You have to show that you are part of the team!"

78
00:03:23.338 --> 00:03:27.586
"Luke!" Matt called out and kicked the ball to him.

79
00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:34.292
At Matt's first match, he was very nervous.

80
00:03:35.313 --> 00:03:38.155
Matt tried to concentrate on what Ben had said about teamwork.

81
00:03:41.578 --> 00:03:43.200
Matt noticed that Victor needed help.

82
00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:46.823
Matt opened his mouth to speak, but no sounds came out.

83
00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:55.561
Matt's team lost one to zero.

84
00:03:57.183 --> 00:04:01.045
"It's all my fault," Matt thought to himself after the game.

85
00:04:01.246 --> 00:04:04.928
"Hey, you played well today," Victor said as he came up to Matt.

86
00:04:04.948 --> 00:04:06.530
"It was your first match.

87
00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:08.391
Next time you'll do better."

88
00:04:11.133 --> 00:04:13.775
Matt's team was not angry with him for losing the game.

89
00:04:13.795 --> 00:04:16.377
"Teamwork! Orchestra!

90
00:04:16.937 --> 00:04:20.220
Harmony!" Matt repeated to himself at the next practice.

91
00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:22.781
Suddenly he saw the ball flying at Georgia.

92
00:04:22.801 --> 00:04:24.161
"Watch out!"

93
00:04:24.461 --> 00:04:26.362
he yelled, jumping in front of it.

94
00:04:26.382 --> 00:04:28.562
"Thanks, Matt," Georgia smiled.

95
00:04:29.943 --> 00:04:32.863
Matt decided to do his best and be a true member of the team.

96
00:04:32.883 --> 00:04:36.605
"Matt!" Victor called and passed him the ball.

97
00:04:36.625 --> 00:04:38.225
"Luke! Here!"

98
00:04:39.005 --> 00:04:40.085
Matt kicked the ball to Luke.

99
00:04:43.726 --> 00:04:46.127
From then on, Matt began to play much better.

100
00:04:46.707 --> 00:04:47.968
His team won every game.

101
00:04:49.088 --> 00:04:51.609
Matt and his team were going to the championship!

102
00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:56.171
Finally it was the day of the big game.

103
00:04:56.191 --> 00:04:58.512
"Don't look at the ball!"

104
00:04:59.072 --> 00:05:00.473
the coach said before the game.

105
00:05:00.493 --> 00:05:02.314
"Don't look at the goal.

106
00:05:02.834 --> 00:05:03.774
Look at your teammates.

107
00:05:04.334 --> 00:05:08.616
Remember! You are all champions whether we win or lose!"

108
00:05:09.677 --> 00:05:12.718
After the first half, the teams were tied at one to one.

109
00:05:13.899 --> 00:05:17.180
Suddenly Matt saw an opportunity to score near the end of the game.

110
00:05:17.652 --> 00:05:19.633
His throat felt dry and his mouth was heavy.

111
00:05:20.153 --> 00:05:22.114
But he knew his team was depending on him.

112
00:05:22.834 --> 00:05:24.255
"Luke! Over here!"

113
00:05:24.635 --> 00:05:25.555
he shouted loudly.

114
00:05:31.898 --> 00:05:36.360
Luke passed the ball, but a player from the other team tackled Matt and knocked him down.

115
00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:38.100
Matt's teammates crowded around him.

116
00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:40.341
"Matt! Are you all right?"

117
00:05:40.801 --> 00:05:41.742
Luke bent over him.

118
00:05:41.762 --> 00:05:43.463
"We got a penalty kick!

119
00:05:43.823 --> 00:05:45.403
This is our big chance, Matt!"

120
00:05:45.844 --> 00:05:46.624
encouraged Victor.

121
00:05:47.252 --> 00:05:48.273
Matt slowly got up.

122
00:05:48.973 --> 00:05:50.334
He had to take the penalty kick.

123
00:05:53.335 --> 00:05:55.196
Matt never felt so scared in his life.

124
00:05:55.937 --> 00:05:57.498
The championship depended on him.

125
00:05:58.038 --> 00:06:03.301
He remembered all of the coach's advice and decided he would try his best for his new friends.

126
00:06:03.701 --> 00:06:06.322
He kicked the ball as hard as he could past the goalkeeper.

127
00:06:06.983 --> 00:06:08.364
Matt's kick scored a goal.

128
00:06:09.644 --> 00:06:12.026
Matt's team was the new soccer champion!

129
00:06:12.046 --> 00:06:13.486
"We won!

130
00:06:13.506 --> 00:06:15.227
You did it, Matt!"

131
00:06:15.427 --> 00:06:16.068
shouted Ben.

132
00:06:16.681 --> 00:06:18.024
"No, we did it!

133
00:06:18.344 --> 00:06:19.968
All of us did it together!"

134
00:06:21.471 --> 00:06:22.073
Matt said.

135
00:06:22.473 --> 00:06:23.275
The coach was right.

136
00:06:23.836 --> 00:06:25.199
Everyone was a champion.
